 	$\operatorname{dir}(\ell_1)\ne0$, using the positive mass from
 	Theorem~\ref{thm:nondegenerate-line-pasting-mass-positive}, and push the
 	result forward along
 	\[
 		\big((\ell_1,x),(\ell_2,z)\big)
 		\longmapsto
